    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s (build %2$d)</string>
    <string name="about_description">TIM-OK Player is an app for watching TV channels, movies and series on Android TV devices, built for the remote control. It shows the programme guide, remembers your favourite channels and resumes movies where you left off.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">TIM-OK Player is only a player and does not contain or deliver any content. Channels, movies and series come from your provider\'s server, through the account you enter yourself. Your provider is responsible for the content and for the right to use it.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">The app collects no analytics and shows no ads. Your login details are stored only on this device.</string>
    <string name="about_ffmpeg">Audio decoding uses FFmpeg (LGPL 2.1+), source code: github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg, version n6.0.1. The app also uses other open-source libraries.</string>
    <string name="about_telegram">Support on Telegram</string>
